---
description: >-
  Classic-look sequence diagram combining central-connection arrows with
  `Note over` and `Note right of` statements, checking that note placement
  is unaffected by the `()` central-connection marker on adjacent messages.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Alice ()->>() Bob: Central connection
  Note over Alice,Bob: Central connection note
  Bob ()-->> Charlie: Reverse central connection
  Note right of Charlie: Response note
  Charlie ()<<-->>() Alice: Dual central connection
